<title>POLAND: CELULOZA JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 10.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>CELULOZA JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 10.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    10.05 vs  14.58</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.55 vs  12.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.97 vs  10.68</p>
<p> Sales		   62.03 vs  58.16</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    20.40 vs  51.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	31.08 vs  90.28</p>
